  m_text: '<b><color=#00F0FF>SECTOR 1: THE POPULAR PACKAGE (MODE)</color></b>

    <color=#E2E8F4>Find
    the cargo number that appears most often in the supply load!</color>


    <b><color=#2AFFA2>SECTOR
    2: THE CENTER CONVEYOR (MEDIAN)</color></b>

    <color=#E2E8F4>Line up cargo
    weights in order and tap the container right in the exact center!</color>


    <b><color=#FFB800>SECTOR
    3: FAIR SHARE BATTERIES (MEAN)</color></b>

    <color=#E2E8F4>Share energy rods
    equally until all four generator towers hold the exact same power!</color>


    <b><color=#99B4FF>SECTOR
    4: DISTANCE GAP (RANGE)</color></b>  -  <b><color=#00F0FF>SECTOR 5: SAFE LANDING</color></b>

    <color=#E2E8F4>Measure
    sensor distance spreads and pick the calmest landing pad for takeoff!</color>'
